Package: piducknng
Type: Package
Title: Compose DuckDB API and Nanonext/Mirai Layers for Pi NNG Endpoints
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Sounkou Mahamane", family = "Toure",
    email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given = "Staysail Systems, Inc. and Capitar IT Group BV",
    role = "cph",
    comment = "NNG copyright holders for vendored ducknng"),
    person(given = "The Mbed TLS Contributors", role = "cph",
    comment = "Mbed TLS copyright holders")
  )
Description: A thin R layer that composes ducknng transport semantics through
    nanonext and mirai. It intentionally adds only discovery-level composition
    and package metadata, without re-implementing transport, session scheduler,
    AIO, transport security, or execution semantics.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    mirai,
    nanonext
Suggests:
    tinytest
